OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, 1, died after 'systematic
OL,4,Aabuse', court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This story contains
OL,7,Fdistressing details
OL,9,FA one-year-old girl was murdered after
OL,10,Fsuffering "systematic physical abuse",
OL,11,Fa court has heard.
OL,13,FIsabella Stasiak was found to have
OL,14,Fsuffered multiple fractures and a fatal
OL,15,Fhead injury when police were called to
OL,16,Fher home in Rugby, Warwickshire, in
OL,17,FJanuary 2025.
