OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, 1, died after 'systematic
OL,4,Aabuse', court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer mother Kinga Wydrzynska, 26, denies
OL,7,Fmurder. She and the girl's father,
OL,8,F28-year-old Michal Stasiak, also deny
OL,9,Fcausing or allowing the death of a
OL,10,Fchild, four counts of causing or
OL,11,Fallowing serious physical harm, two
OL,12,Fcounts of sexual assault by penetration
OL,13,Fand three of child cruelty.
